                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 880,
                  "top": 190,
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Composite (RF-23): un concepto es simple o un grupo;\nLiquidacion suma venta − costos − pérdidas − comisión."
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "UJsc0pttblJHDZdV",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "Wkn1bBsrwvh7cwaF"
                  },
                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 2140,
                  "top": 190,
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Proxy (RNF-02): solo el dueño o un analista abre\nel documento; cada acceso queda registrado."
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "aAVk3/gswOOARn+f",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "Wkn1bBsrwvh7cwaF"
                  },
                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 880,
                  "top": 932,
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Facade (RF-03/04): dos operaciones esconden almacén\ncifrado, proveedor, umbral, historial y aviso."
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "/INrMYJvW/cLTKBl",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "Wkn1bBsrwvh7cwaF"
                  },
                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 2140,
                  "top": 842,
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Decorator (RNF-02): AlmacenCifrado cifra con AES-256-GCM\nantes de pasar los bytes a AlmacenDisco."
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "VY3igi6LZDL758r1",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "Wkn1bBsrwvh7cwaF"
                  },
                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 1111,
                  "top": 1114,
                  "width": 360,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Bridge (RF-02/04): qué se dice (Aviso)\nseparado de por dónde llega (ICanalAviso)."
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "+WXhn//6GJxuxo6z",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "Wkn1bBsrwvh7cwaF"
                  },
                  "font": "Arial;13;0",
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#111111",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#111111",
                  "left": 2980,
                  "top": 1570,
                  "width": 420,
                  "height": 52,
                  "text": "Adapter: CorreoSmtpService traduce ICorreoService a SmtpClient.\nDecorator: CorreoConReintentos reintenta el envío."
                }
              ]
            },
